Version 4
SymbolType BLOCK
LINE Normal -24 0 -32 -8
LINE Normal -32 8 -24 0
RECTANGLE Normal 16 16 -32 -16
TEXT -8 -8 Center 2 1HZ
TEXT -7 7 Center 2 LowPass
SYMATTR Prefix x
SYMATTR SpiceModel 1Hz
SYMATTR Description 1Hz lowpass
SYMATTR ModelFile measure.lib
PIN -32 0 NONE 0
PINATTR PinName in
PINATTR SpiceOrder 1
PIN 16 0 NONE 0
PINATTR PinName out
PINATTR SpiceOrder 2
